{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The main defects are localized: the customer-order endpoint rejects missing customers before querying the durable `CUSTOMER_ID` stored on orders; the list facade discards totals and returns `null` for empty pages; and the repository’s pagination/count path has an incorrect page-count calculation plus collection-fetch pagination hazards. I’m patching those paths while keeping the order’s stored billing/delivery/email data untouched."}}
